# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Everything here is OPTIONAL. With no keys at all, Smallbox runs on
# OpenStreetMap plus community submissions — which is already the majority of
# its coverage. Each key switches on one more source.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Reads local news coverage for pop-up, seasonal and brand-new markets that
# aren't mapped anywhere yet. Also required for the festivals source below,
# which needs to judge whether an event actually sells food.
# Key: https://console.anthropic.com/
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Model used for that extraction. Defaults to claude-opus-5.
# SMALLBOX_EXTRACT_MODEL=claude-opus-5

# The USDA's curated directory of US farmers markets. Free key:
# https://www.usdalocalfoodportal.com/fe/apikey/
USDA_API_KEY=

# Google Places (New). Best coverage and hours, but billed per request and its
# terms restrict storing results — so nothing from Google is ever written to the
# database. https://developers.google.com/maps/documentation/places/web-service
GOOGLE_PLACES_API_KEY=

# Festivals and one-off markets from Ticketmaster Discovery. Free key:
# https://developer-acct.ticketmaster.com/
TICKETMASTER_API_KEY=

# Where the community-submissions SQLite file lives. Defaults to ./data/smallbox.db
# SMALLBOX_DB_PATH=

# Set to 1 to hold submissions for approval instead of publishing immediately.
# SMALLBOX_MODERATE_SUBMISSIONS=0
